      "priority": "high",
      "details": "The core translation infrastructure is substantially implemented. Key achievements include: Rails I18n configured with pt-BR as the default locale, organized locale file structure for both backend and frontend, functional translation helpers, i18n-tasks integrated and configured, and Vue.js frontend configured for pt-BR across all entrypoints. The default locale has been changed from 'en' to 'pt_BR' in all Vue.js entrypoints: dashboard.js, widget.js, survey.js, and v3app.js. The infrastructure is functional and ready to support the development of future AutomatizaSE features.",
