      "priority": "high",
      "details": "Focus exclusively on replacing all textual elements of 'Chatwoot' with 'AutomatizaSE' throughout the platform. This includes updating strings, labels, messages, and documentation. Do not alter colors, logos, icons, or any visual/graphic elements. Ensure that all application name configurations reflect 'AutomatizaSE'.",
      "testStrategy": "Verify that all instances of 'Chatwoot' have been replaced with 'AutomatizaSE' across different browsers and devices. Test that email templates display the correct brand name. Validate that all user interfaces consistently show 'AutomatizaSE' in place of 'Chatwoot'.",
      "subtasks": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "title": "Set Up Brand Configuration System",
          "description": "Develop a centralized system to manage and apply brand elements consistently across the application.",
          "dependencies": [],
          "details": "Create a configuration system that stores brand assets such as logos, color schemes, and typography. This system should allow for easy updates and ensure uniform application of brand elements throughout the application.\n<info added on 2025-05-30T19:50:35.821Z>\n## ✅ SISTEMA DE CONFIGURAÇÃO DE MARCA CONCLUÍDO\n\n**🎯 ARQUIVOS CRIADOS:**\n\n**✅ 1. ARQUIVO DE CONFIGURAÇÃO (config/brand.yml):**\n- Configuração centralizada da marca AutomatizaSE\n- Informações básicas: nome, tagline, descrição\n- URLs: website, suporte, termos, privacidade\n- Assets: logos, favicon\n- Paleta de cores brasileira (verde/amarelo)\n- Tipografia: Inter/Roboto\n- Redes sociais e localização\n- Features brasileiras: formato de data, telefone, moeda, CPF/CNPJ\n\n**✅ 2. CLASSE GERENCIADORA (lib/brand_config.rb):**\n- Singleton pattern para acesso global\n- Métodos para acessar todas as configurações\n- Carregamento do YAML com fallbacks\n- Integração com GlobalConfig\n- Geração de CSS custom properties\n- Reload dinâmico para desenvolvimento\n- 189 linhas de código robusto\n\n**✅ 3. HELPER PARA VIEWS (app/helpers/brand_helper.rb):**\n- 197 linhas de métodos auxiliares\n- Geração de tags de imagem para logos\n- Meta tags para SEO/Open Graph\n- Links para redes sociais\n- CSS variables para cores\n- Verificação de features brasileiras\n- Título de páginas brandizado\n\n**✅ 4. INICIALIZADOR (config/initializers/brand_config.rb):**\n- Carregamento automático na inicialização\n- Atualização do GlobalConfig em produção\n- Configuração de timezone brasileiro\n- Logs informativos\n- Tratamento de erros robusto\n- Constantes para facilitar acesso\n\n**🔧 SISTEMA IMPLEMENTADO:**\n- Carregamento automático das configurações\n- Fallbacks seguros para valores padrão\n- Integração com sistema existente\n- Preparado para features brasileiras\n- Paleta de cores verde/amarelo do Brasil\n- Pronto para uso em layouts e views\n</info added on 2025-05-30T19:50:35.821Z>",
          "status": "done"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "title": "Replace Brand Assets",
          "description": "Update all instances of brand assets, including logos and favicons, to reflect the new branding.",
          "dependencies": [
            1
          ],
          "details": "Identify all locations where brand assets are used within the application. Replace existing logos and favicons with the new versions, ensuring they are correctly sized and formatted for each use case.\n<info added on 2025-05-30T19:53:31.681Z>\nFocus on rebranding textual elements by replacing all instances of \"Chatwoot\" with \"AutomatizaSE\" throughout the application. Maintain existing logos and visual assets for now, while preparing the structure for future updates. Ensure global configurations reflect the new name, AutomatizaSE, and prioritize the application of textual rebranding across layouts.\n</info added on 2025-05-30T19:53:31.681Z>\n<info added on 2025-05-30T19:56:25.676Z>\nRebranding textual elements has been successfully completed. \n\nUpdated Files:\n\n1. Global Configurations (config/installation_config.yml):\n   - INSTALLATION_NAME: 'Chatwoot' → 'AutomatizaSE'\n   - BRAND_NAME: 'Chatwoot' → 'AutomatizaSE'\n   - BRAND_URL: chatwoot.com → automatizase.com\n   - WIDGET_BRAND_URL: chatwoot.com → automatizase.com\n   - TERMS_URL: /terms-of-service → /termos-de-servico\n   - PRIVACY_URL: /privacy-policy → /politica-de-privacidade\n   - DISPLAY_MANIFEST: title updated to AutomatizaSE\n   - Internal descriptions updated\n\n2. Email Templates (devise/mailer/confirmation_instructions.html.erb):\n   - Fallbacks updated: 'Chatwoot' → 'AutomatizaSE'\n   - Welcome and confirmation messages updated\n\n3. Onboarding Pages (installation/onboarding/index.html.erb):\n   - Title: 'SuperAdmin | Chatwoot' → 'SuperAdmin | AutomatizaSE'\n   - Logo alt text: 'Chatwoot' → 'AutomatizaSE'\n   - Welcome message: 'Howdy, Welcome to Chatwoot' → 'Olá, Bem-vindo ao AutomatizaSE'\n   - Fields translated to Portuguese: Name → Nome, Company Name → Nome da Empresa, etc.\n   - Placeholders localized with Brazilian examples\n   - Button: 'Finish Setup' → 'Finalizar Configuração'\n\n4. Super Admin Login (super_admin/devise/sessions/new.html.erb):\n   - Title updated to AutomatizaSE\n   - Logo alt text updated\n\n5. Super Admin Navigation (super_admin/application/_navigation.html.erb):\n   - Alt text: 'Chatwoot Admin Dashboard' → 'AutomatizaSE Admin Dashboard'\n   - Version: 'Chatwoot' → 'AutomatizaSE'\n   - Console: 'Super Admin Console' → 'Console Super Admin'\n   - Labels translated: Settings → Configurações, Sidekiq Dashboard → Painel Sidekiq, etc.\n\nNext Steps:\n- Visual assets temporarily retained (Chatwoot logos)\n- Prepared to receive new assets when necessary\n- Folder structure `/brand-assets/` maintained\n</info added on 2025-05-30T19:56:25.676Z>",
          "status": "done"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
