          "details": "Update the PWA manifest file to replace 'Chatwoot' with 'AutomatizaSE' in all textual configurations. Ensure that the PWA reflects the new brand name consistently, without altering visual assets.\n<info added on 2025-05-30T20:20:10.492Z>\nThe PWA configuration has been successfully updated to reflect the new brand name, AutomatizaSE. The manifest file and relevant JavaScript localization files have been modified to replace 'Chatwoot' with 'AutomatizaSE', ensuring consistency across the application. Visual elements such as icons, colors, and display settings have been preserved as instructed. The service worker and Windows configuration files were verified and required no changes. The PWA now displays 'AutomatizaSE' as the app name, and users will see this upon installation, with offline functionalities maintained. Ready to proceed with updating layout files.\n</info added on 2025-05-30T20:20:10.492Z>",
